category: Libs
requires: cygwin libbabeltrace1 libglib2.0_0 python312
sdesc: "Trace Viewer and Converter, mainly for the Common Trace Format (python3.12 bindings)"
ldesc: "This project provides trace read and write libraries, as well as a trace
converter. A plugin can be created for any trace format to allow its conversion
to/from another trace format."
external-source: babeltrace

